B.bPN=s(["Very limited without matricule number.","Croix-Rouge luxembourgeoise provides assistance.","POST Finance may offer basic services with limited documentation."],t.s)
B.aR3=s(["BCEE (Spuerkeess) \u2014 state bank, multilingual (FR/DE/EN/LU/PT), competitive fees","BGL BNP Paribas \u2014 largest private bank, multilingual staff, good expat services","ING Luxembourg \u2014 competitive online banking, English/French","Revolut \u2014 EUR IBAN, multilingual, popular with cross-border workers","Wise \u2014 multi-currency, excellent for international workers","N26 \u2014 German IBAN, multilingual app"],t.s)
