B.ajK=new A.et("Slovenia",B.aR7,B.axA,B.aPn,"Dav\u010dna \u0161tevilka (Tax Number)","Apply at FURS (Finan\u010dna uprava Republike Slovenije) with passport and residence proof. Processing: 1-7 days. Can also be obtained at Upravna enota (administrative unit).","Residents taxed on worldwide income. Progressive PIT: 16%-50% (5 brackets). Social contributions: approximately 22.1% employee + 16.1% employer. Annual return due March 31 (pre-filled return reviewed by May 31).","March 31 for previous year. Pre-filled returns reviewed by May 31.","https://www.fu.gov.si","EU Consumer Credit Directive transposed. Banka Slovenije supervises. SISBON credit bureau. SECCI mandatory. 14-day withdrawal.","Banka Slovenije / ATVP (Securities Market Agency)","+386 1 471 90 00 (Banka Slovenije)","Banka Slovenije handles banking complaints. Also: European Consumer Centre Slovenia for cross-border disputes.","Slovenia is small, safe, and uses EUR. PIC (Pravno-informacijski center) provides free legal assistance to immigrants. IOM Slovenia assists with integration. Cost of living moderate (lower than Austria/Italy but higher than Croatia/Hungary). Slovenian language essential for integration \u2014 free courses available. Slovenian Philanthropy (Slovenska filantropija) works with refugees on integration including financial literacy.")
