B.b2r=new A.C("Consular Access","Foreign prisoners are informed of their right to contact their consulate at intake. Finland strictly respects Vienna Convention obligations. Prison staff assist with consular communication.","Estonian and Russian nationals are the largest foreign prisoner groups. Consular access is well facilitated. Request immediately upon detention.")
