B.bVK=s(["Vienna Convention Art. 36","Code de Proc\xe9dure P\xe9nale Art. 63-1"],t.s)
B.b5n=new A.C("Consular Access","Right to consular notification upon arrest (garde \xe0 vue). France has one of the largest prison populations in Western Europe with significant foreign prisoner numbers. Established consular procedures.",null)
B.bI6=s(["Code de Proc\xe9dure P\xe9nale Art. 63-1, 803-5","EU Directive 2010/64/EU"],t.s)
B.b5y=new A.C("Right to Interpreter","Free interpreter from garde \xe0 vue through trial. Sworn interpreters required. Translation of essential documents. Arabic, English, and major European languages well served.",null)
B.bOW=s(["Loi n\xb0 2013-711 du 5 ao\xfbt 2013","EU Framework Decision 2008/909/JHA","Numerous bilateral conventions"],t.s)
B.b5G=new A.C("Transfer to Home Country","FD 2008/909/JHA implemented. France actively transfers prisoners, particularly to North African states under bilateral agreements. CoE Convention ETS 112 for non-EU states. Bilateral treaties with Morocco, Tunisia, Algeria, Turkey, and others.",null)
B.c_N=s(["Loi du 10 juillet 1991 (Legal Aid Act)","Code de Proc\xe9dure P\xe9nale Art. 63-3-1","EU Directive 2016/1919/EU"],t.s)
B.b4U=new A.C("Legal Aid","Aide juridictionnelle available for persons below income threshold. Automatic for garde \xe0 vue. Mandatory defence for serious offences. Bureau d'aide juridictionnelle at each court.",null)
B.bR2=s(["Code de Proc\xe9dure P\xe9nale Art. 714-728","Loi P\xe9nitentiaire 2009","ECtHR J.M.B. v. France (2020)"],t.s)
B.b43=new A.C("Prison Conditions","Severe overcrowding (140%+ occupancy rate nationally, higher in maisons d'arr\xeat). ECtHR has repeatedly found violations (J.M.B. v. France 2020 \u2014 pilot judgment on overcrowding). Newer centres de d\xe9tention have better conditions. Contr\xf4leur g\xe9n\xe9ral des lieux de privation de libert\xe9 (CGLPL) monitors conditions.","Conditions in maisons d'arr\xeat (pre-trial/short sentences) are worst. Centres de d\xe9tention and centres p\xe9nitentiaires are better. File complaints to Juge d'application des peines or CGLPL.")
B.c2E=s(["Code de Proc\xe9dure P\xe9nale Art. 35, 39, 145-4","Loi P\xe9nitentiaire 2009"],t.s)
B.b4y=new A.C("Communication Rights","At least 3 visits per month (parloir). Phone access via pre-paid system. Letters unrestricted for sentenced prisoners. Unit\xe9s de vie familiale (family apartments) for longer visits in some prisons.",null)
B.bGa=s(["Code de la Sant\xe9 Publique Art. L6141-5","Loi du 18 janvier 1994"],t.s)
B.b35=new A.C("Healthcare","Healthcare provided by public hospital service (UCSA/USMP units in each prison). Equivalent to community care in principle. SMPR psychiatric units. Drug substitution (methadone, Subutex) widely available.",null)
B.bLQ=s(["Loi P\xe9nitentiaire 2009 Art. 26","Loi du 9 d\xe9cembre 1905 (la\xefcit\xe9)"],t.s)
B.b2_=new A.C("Religious Rights","Catholic, Protestant, Muslim, Jewish, Orthodox, and Buddhist chaplains. France has one of the largest Muslim prison populations in Europe. Halal meals available. Prayer rooms (la\xefcit\xe9 principle applies).",null)
B.bNY=s(["Code P\xe9nal Art. 131-30 (ITF)","CESEDA Art. L611-1 (OQTF)","EU Directive 2004/38/EC"],t.s)
B.b3J=new A.C("Immigration Consequences","Court can impose interdiction du territoire fran\xe7ais (ITF) as criminal sentence (5-10 years or permanent). Pr\xe9fecture can also issue obligation de quitter le territoire (OQTF). EU citizens: higher protection.",null)
B.bXD=s(["Code de Proc\xe9dure P\xe9nale Art. 729-733"],t.s)
B.b5O=new A.C("Early Release / Parole","Lib\xe9ration conditionnelle after half the sentence (two-thirds for recidivists). R\xe9ductions de peine (sentence reductions) for good conduct. Foreign prisoners eligible but practical barriers exist (no address, no employment). Lib\xe9ration sous contrainte (compulsory release under restrictions) at two-thirds.",null)
B.bUy=s(["CESEDA Art. L741-1","EU Return Directive 2008/115/EC"],t.s)
B.b4Z=new A.C("Deportation After Sentence","ITF or OQTF enforced by Pr\xe9fecture upon release. Centres de r\xe9tention administrative (CRA) if removal not immediate (max 90 days). Non-refoulement applies. High number of CRA placements after prison.",null)
B.bWR=s(["Code de Proc\xe9dure P\xe9nale Art. 695-11 to 695-51","EU Framework Decision 2002/584/JHA"],t.s)
B.b4t=new A.C("European Arrest Warrant","Chambre de l'instruction at Court of Appeal handles EAW. French nationals can be surrendered (constitutional amendment 2003). Active user of EAW.",null)
B.aNZ=s([B.b5n,B.b5y,B.b5G,B.b4U,B.b43,B.b4y,B.b35,B.b2_,B.b3J,B.b5O,B.b4Z,B.b4t],t.D)
