B.b3D=new A.C("Prison Conditions","Overcrowding has been a major issue. ECtHR pilot judgment Varga v. Hungary (2015) found systematic violation of Art. 3. Compensation scheme introduced. Prison building programme underway. CPT has noted violence and corruption issues.","Apply for compensation under the Varga mechanism if subjected to overcrowded conditions (below 3m\xb2 personal space).")
