B.bz6=new A.eC()
B.a3Q=new A.e1("Slovenia","SI",B.aM6,B.b_N,"ZZZS mandatory basic + mandatory supplementary insurance. Unique in EU: supplementary is quasi-mandatory (covers co-payments). Three supplementary insurers.","6.36% employee + 6.56% employer for basic. Supplementary ~35 EUR/month individual.","~12.92% for health + mandatory supplementary ~35 EUR/month","Slovenia unique requirement: MANDATORY supplementary health insurance (dopolnilno). Must purchase from Vzajemna, Triglav Zdravstvena, or Generali. Without it, you pay full co-payments (up to 90% of some services). Pension system links well with former Yugoslav states. Highway e-vignette required.")
B.aqL=new A.bc("Health Insurance (SNS)","Tax-funded. No separate health premium. Social security covers pension/unemployment.","Register at local health center (centro de salud) with empadronamiento (municipal registration). Get SIP/TSI health card. Need NIE (foreigner ID number). All registered residents covered.")
B.aqp=new A.bc("Car Insurance (TPL)","300-800 EUR/year","Need Spanish registration (matricula). ITV (inspection) for imported vehicles. Compare at rastreator.com, acierto.com.")
