B.a3C=new A.e1("Spain","ES",B.aGH,B.b_K,"SNS (Sistema Nacional de Salud). Universal tax-funded. 17 regional health services. Free at point of use. Prescription co-payment based on income (0-60%).","No separate health premium. Funded through general taxation and social security.","Autonomos pay ~30% social security contribution (covers pension, health, sick leave). Minimum base ~300 EUR/month.","Spain requires empadronamiento (municipal registration) for health card. Private health insurance mandatory for non-lucrative visa, digital nomad visa, student visa. Spain pays pensions in 14 installments (12 monthly + 2 extra pays). Extensive bilateral agreements with Latin America. Non-contributory pension available for 10+ years residence. Autonomos (self-employed) system being reformed with income-based contributions since 2023.")
B.apG=new A.bc("Health Insurance (Forsakringskassan)","Tax-funded. No separate premium. Employer social contribution (arbetsgivaravgift): 31.42% includes health.","Register with Skatteverket (tax authority) to get personnummer. Then register with local vardcentral (health center). EU citizens need right of residence. Non-EU: residence permit required.")
B.aqZ=new A.bc("Car Insurance (TPL)","SEK 3,000-12,000/year (~260-1,050 EUR)","Need Swedish registration (Transportstyrelsen). Compare at compricer.se, konsumenternas.se.")
B.azh=s([B.apG,B.aqZ],t.e)
