B.a3P=new A.e1("Sweden","SE",B.azh,B.b_I,"Universal tax-funded healthcare via 21 regions. Patient fees capped (hogkostnadsskydd): max SEK 1,300/year for visits, SEK 2,850/year for prescriptions.","No separate premium. Employer pays arbetsgivaravgift 31.42% which includes health insurance component.","Egenavgifter ~28.97% of net income","Sweden has excellent pension tracking at minpension.se (all pillars in one place). Personnummer essential for everything. Guarantee pension is residence-based (40 years for full). Income pension earnings-related from first day of work. Occupational pension (tjenstepension) adds significantly - ensure employer provides it. Hemforsakring (home insurance) almost universally held and includes valuable legal protection benefit.")
