B.aue=new A.aw("Juridisk\u0101 pal\u012bdz\u012bba (Legal Aid Administration)","Latvia","LV","legal_aid","+371 67 514 208","jpa@jpa.gov.lv","https://www.jpa.gov.lv","State legal aid administration providing free legal consultations and representation for low-income residents, including asylum seekers.",B.n_)
B.asu=new A.aw("Latvijas Cilv\u0113kties\u012bbu centrs (Latvian Centre for Human Rights)","Latvia","LV","ngo","+371 67 240 386","office@humanrights.org.lv","https://cilvektiesibas.org.lv","NGO providing legal assistance on asylum and migration issues, anti-discrimination work, and human rights monitoring.",B.n_)
