B.a8b=new A.eJ("Irish Human Rights and Equality Commission (IHREC) / Workplace Relations Commission (WRC)","IHREC: 16-22 Green Street, Dublin 7. Tel: +353 1 858 9601. WRC: O'Brien Road, Carlow. Tel: +353 59 917 8990")
B.U5=new A.eB("Islamic burial sections in Dublin (Newcastle Muslim Cemetery), Cork, Galway. Islamic Foundation of Ireland manages burial. Burial without coffin permitted in some sections.")
