B.TZ=new A.eB("Muslim sections in Ljubljana (\u017dale cemetery) and some other cities. Islamic Community manages burial.")
B.bzx=new A.eE()
B.b8Q=new A.ec("Slovenia","SI","Constitution Art 7, 41 (freedom of religion, separation of state and religion); Religious Freedom Act 2007 (Zakon o verski svobodi); Protection Against Discrimination Act 2016.","Art 7: State and religious communities separated. Religious communities have equal rights. Art 41: Freedom of religion, right to freely express religious and other beliefs.",B.akp,B.b8H,B.b83,B.b17,B.a8p,B.TZ,"Slovenia has a significant Bosniak Muslim community (~50,000, ~2.5%). Ljubljana Mosque opened in 2020 after 50 years of effort \u2014 major milestone. Religious Freedom Act 2007 provides progressive framework. No face covering ban, no headscarf restrictions. Ritual slaughter without stunning banned. Islamic Community of Slovenia (Islamska skupnost v Republiki Sloveniji) is registered. Generally improving environment after mosque opening breakthrough.")
B.akk=new A.eP("Cooperation Agreement Art 14: halal food in public schools, hospitals, prisons, military. Implementation varies by Autonomous Community. Catalonia, Madrid, Andaluc\xeda more developed.","Widely available. Spain has ~2 million Muslims. Large Moroccan community. Ceuta and Melilla have extensive halal infrastructure.")
B.b8l=new A.f0("Cooperation Agreement Art 12: Muslim employees have right to leave for Eid al-Fitr, Eid al-Adha, and Mawlid. May request Friday prayer time (1:30-4:30 PM) by agreement with employer. Ramadan working hours adjustable by agreement.")
