B.U6=new A.eB("Cooperation Agreement Art 2: right to Islamic burial rites. Islamic sections in many municipal cemeteries (Granada, Seville, Madrid, Barcelona, Valencia). Ceuta and Melilla have Muslim cemeteries. Burial without coffin: varies by Autonomous Community.")
B.bzy=new A.eE()
B.b8Y=new A.ec("Spain","ES","Constitution Art 14 (equality), Art 16 (freedom of religion); Organic Law 7/1980 on Religious Freedom; Cooperation Agreements 1992 (with Protestant, Jewish, Islamic communities); Equality Law 2007 (Ley de Igualdad).","Art 16: Freedom of ideology, religion and worship guaranteed. No state religion. Public powers cooperate with Catholic Church and other denominations. Cooperation Agreements with CIE (Comisi\xf3n Isl\xe1mica de Espa\xf1a) since 1992 \u2014 one of the most comprehensive Islamic agreements in Europe.",B.akk,B.b8l,B.b8c,B.b0U,B.a8r,B.U6,"Spain has one of Europe's most comprehensive legal frameworks for Islam through the 1992 Cooperation Agreement with CIE. This provides explicit rights for halal food, religious education, burial, chaplaincy, holidays, and Friday prayer. Implementation varies by Autonomous Community \u2014 Catalonia, Madrid, Andaluc\xeda most developed. No face covering ban (Supreme Court struck down municipal bans). No headscarf ban. Ritual slaughter permitted. ~2 million Muslims, mainly Moroccan origin. Ceuta and Melilla have Eid as local holidays. ~1,700 mosques/prayer halls. Plataforma Ciudadana contra la Islamofobia monitors anti-Muslim discrimination.")
B.akh=new A.eP("School Food Act requires schools to provide nutritious free meals. Many municipalities accommodate halal/special diets. Stockholm, Gothenburg, Malm\xf6 widely offer halal options.","Widely available nationwide. Large Muslim population (~800,000, ~8%). Strong halal market.")
B.b8s=new A.f0("Employees may use annual leave. Discrimination Act requires reasonable accommodation. DO (Equality Ombudsman) has addressed cases.")
B.b7U=new A.eZ("Generally permitted. Discrimination Act protects against religious discrimination in employment. AD (Labour Court) has addressed headscarf cases.","Face covering ban in schools enacted 2020 (applies to niqab/burqa in education settings \u2014 preschool through upper secondary). No general public space ban.")
