B.Ua=new A.eB("Islamic sections in many municipal cemeteries. Stockholm (J\xe4rva, Skogskyrkog\xe5rden), Gothenburg, Malm\xf6, Uppsala. Burial without coffin: permitted in some municipalities (Malm\xf6 allows shroud burial). 25 years minimum grave tenure (renewable).")
