B.auw=new A.ds("Austria","AT",B.cC,"Same-sex marriage legal since January 1, 2019, following Constitutional Court ruling (VfGH G 258-259/2017). Previously registered partnerships were available from 2010.",!0,"Apply at BFA (Federal Office for Immigration and Asylum). SOGI claims are recognized grounds under the Asylum Act (AsylG 2005). Personal interview conducted by trained officers. Credibility assessment must follow UNHCR guidelines - cannot demand proof of sexual acts.","Queer Base (queerbase.at) - specialized asylum support. UNHCR Austria. Asyl in Not.",!0,B.ds,B.hg,"Generally safe, especially in Vienna. Vienna Pride is one of Europe's largest. Rural areas may be less accepting. Police are generally responsive to hate crimes.",61,"EU/EEA citizens can register partnerships/marriages performed abroad. Third-country nationals with valid residence permits have equal access to partnership registration. Family reunification includes same-sex spouses since 2019.","Austria has specific SOGI asylum guidelines. Queer Base provides specialized support from first interview through integration. Reception centers in Vienna have LGBTQ+ safe spaces. Risk of harm in shared accommodation should be raised with BFA immediately.")
B.dA=new A.DG(0,"verySafe")
