B.avW=new A.bk("asylum support, legal aid")
B.bQZ=s([B.avk,B.av4,B.avW],t.Q)
B.auq=new A.ds("Luxembourg","LU",B.cC,"Same-sex marriage legal since January 1, 2015. First sitting EU prime minister (Xavier Bettel) married same-sex partner. Registered partnerships (partenariat) available since 2004.",!0,"Apply at Direction de l'immigration. SOGI claims recognized. Interview with protection officer. Appeal to Administrative Tribunal. L\xebtzebuerger Fl\xfcchtlingsrot (LFR) provides support.","Fondation L\xebtzebuerger Fl\xfcchtlingsrot, Rosa L\xebtzebuerg, CIGALE, CLAE.",!0,B.ds,B.dA,"Very safe and progressive. Small, multicultural country with strong LGBTQ+ rights. Luxembourg Pride well-attended. High public acceptance. Government actively supports LGBTQ+ equality.",72,"Foreign same-sex marriages fully recognized. Family reunification for same-sex spouses. Multicultural country with large immigrant population (47%+ foreign-born). Registration straightforward at commune.","Small number of asylum seekers. SOGI claims well-handled in an intimate system. Rosa L\xebtzebuerg and LFR provide support. Good coordination between organizations due to small country size.")
