B.auv=new A.ds("Malta","MT",B.cC,"Same-sex marriage legal since September 1, 2017 (Marriage Act amendment). Civil unions available since 2014. Malta has consistently ranked #1 on ILGA-Europe Rainbow Index.",!0,"Apply to Office of the Refugee Commissioner. SOGI claims well-recognized. Interview with protection officer. Malta has specific SOGI asylum guidelines. Appeal to Refugee Appeals Board.","MGRM (Malta LGBTIQ Rights Movement), aditus foundation, JRS Malta (Jesuit Refugee Service).",!0,B.ds,B.dA,"Top-ranked EU country for LGBTQ+ rights consistently. Remarkable transformation from strongly Catholic conservative to progressive leader. Valletta Pride well-attended. Very high public acceptance. Government actively champions LGBTQ+ rights internationally.",89,"Foreign same-sex marriages fully recognized. Family reunification for spouses. Malta has world-leading LGBTQ+ legislation. Registration at Identity Malta straightforward. Small, welcoming community.","Malta processes asylum claims from Mediterranean arrivals. Strong LGBTQ+ legal framework benefits SOGI claimants. aditus foundation is key legal support. Small system means personalized attention. Accommodation may be crowded due to island geography.")
