B.aup=new A.ds("Portugal","PT",B.cC,"Same-sex marriage legal since June 5, 2010 (Law 9/2010). De facto unions (uni\xf5es de facto) recognized since 2001. First Iberian country.",!0,"Apply at SEF (Servi\xe7o de Estrangeiros e Fronteiras, now reorganized as AIMA - Ag\xeancia para a Integra\xe7\xe3o, Migra\xe7\xf5es e Asilo). SOGI claims well-recognized. Personal interview. Portuguese Council for Refugees (CPR) provides legal aid.","ILGA Portugal, Portuguese Council for Refugees (CPR), Rede ex aequo, JRS Portugal.",!0,B.ds,B.dA,"Very safe and welcoming. Lisbon has vibrant LGBTQ+ scene (Pr\xedncipe Real neighborhood). Pride in Lisbon and Porto well-attended. Very high public acceptance. Portugal has transformed dramatically since decriminalization of homosexuality (1982). One of Europe's most LGBTQ+ friendly countries.",73,"Foreign same-sex marriages fully recognized. De facto unions available to foreign nationals. Family reunification for same-sex spouses. Portugal actively attracts immigrants with favorable policies. Lisbon and Porto are main LGBTQ+ hubs.","Portugal is welcoming for LGBTQ+ asylum seekers. CPR provides excellent legal support. ILGA Portugal offers community integration. System experienced though small. Accommodation through AIMA. Lisbon has the most resources.")
B.aw7=new A.bk("community, advocacy, legal aid")
B.avO=new A.bk("asylum support, legal aid")
